    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Urgh, Urgha and Claw the Cave Bear must survive the harsh prehistoric winter - help them gather resources and craft their way to cozy and warm spring!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't Freeze is a simple, bite-sized worker placement board game in which you must gather materials, convert them to usable resources and make sure that the entire family (including the bear) survives a set number of turns. You must hunt to provide food, collect wood to kindle the fire and gather herbs to turn into medicine in case someone gets sick.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple rules and small numbers allow you to quickly grasp the game and don't stand in the way of interesting strategic and tactical choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One game lasts only a few minutes - perfect for a coffee break</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several difficulty levels will infect you with the &quot;just one more game&quot; syndrome</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adorable programmer art instead of AI nonsense</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed solo in the middle of a harsh Polish winter. Well, maybe not that harsh, but still winter. There were negative temperatures in the middle of April for crying out loud!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Urgh, Urgha and Claw the Cave Bear must survive the harsh prehistoric winter - help them gather resources and craft their way to cozy and warm spring!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't Freeze is a simple, bite-sized worker placement board game in which you must gather materials, convert them to usable resources and make sure that the entire family (including the bear) survives a set number of turns. You must hunt to provide food, collect wood to kindle the fire and gather herbs to turn into medicine in case someone gets sick.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple rules and small numbers allow you to quickly grasp the game and don't stand in the way of interesting strategic and tactical choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One game lasts only a few minutes - perfect for a coffee break</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several difficulty levels will infect you with the &quot;just one more game&quot; syndrome</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adorable programmer art instead of AI nonsense</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed solo in the middle of a harsh Polish winter. Well, maybe not that harsh, but still winter. There were negative temperatures in the middle of April for crying out loud!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Help Urgh, Urgha and Claw the Cave Bear survive the harsh winter. Hunt, collect wood and pick herbs to ensure that your cave remains nice and cozy. Make sure you don't catch a cold!",
